{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o028b","title":"高柔任司空","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o028b-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"高柔任司空","evidence":["shaodi-e-o028b-q"]},{"id":"hancui-a-3df1d1380403e18d1faf","label":"正文","text":"高柔旬日迁司空","evidence":["hancui-q-13a0f49c5c156bf27081"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0017","role":"受任","evidence":["shaodi-e-o028b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":245,"label":"八月丁卯","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y245","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o027","basis":"八月丁卯"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o028b-q","shaodi-q-o027","shaodi-q-b-ffaf273e80312d879f6a"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o028b-q","source_order":[4,110,"O028b"],"order":1030}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0017","name":"高柔","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hancui-q-13a0f49c5c156bf27081","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-24a29ebf8cf0df3164ca","layer":"original","quote":"旬日迁司空。后徙司徒。太傅司马宣王奏免曹爽，皇太后诏召柔〖1〗，假节，行大将军事，据爽营。太傅谓柔曰：“君为周勃矣〖2〗。”爽诛，进封万岁乡侯。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":324,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":12,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o028b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-1740ef664b4d4e239d6c","layer":"original","quote":"夏六月，俨薨。八月。丁卯〖4〗，以太常高柔为司空。癸巳〖5〗，以左光禄大夫刘放为骠骑将军，右光禄大夫孙资为卫将军。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":109,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-ffaf273e80312d879f6a","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ffaf273e80312d879f6a","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：正始六年（公元 245）。丁卯：旧历十七日。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":117,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6a775c04ceecfbe9bbb8","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o027","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-8413104b61ef295c89cc","layer":"original","quote":"六年春二月，丁卯〖1〗，南安郡地震。丙子〖2〗，以骠骑将军赵俨为司空〖3〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
